navigate the 3D surface to find your way to the goal.\n\nUnlock the Surprise: Once you reach the goal, watch as a special CG model pops out from inside the box!\n\nKey Features\nSpatial Puzzle Experience: Enhances your spatial awareness as you manipulate objects in 3D space.\n\nIntuitive Controls: Designed for VR\u2014simply grab, rotate, and trace.\n\nSatisfying Rewards: A fun variety of CG surprises await you at the end of every maze.\n\nCan you find the path to the goal? Spin the box and start the challenge today!", "short_description": "Play the box maze!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/mazeboxvr2/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "\u4e09\u6b21\u5143\u8ff7\u8def\u5de5\u623f", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/mazeboxvr2/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25317963134566684"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618102_878449377897320_4347997139507708816_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gVud6oB9lgYQ7kNvwFJ6ty_&_nc_oc=AdrsfZbw5tfYKZyVsWhUwXYRdyCvzA0ox4thy08fBP5nyKEyt66qQt3rV_Jt_Mm0CZ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2HngGNz9AH0PWv04HVwSWGJuzctfxuxDw0vR